    visibleText:
      'Venue Function Rooms, Level 3, Core E, Cyberport 3, Hong Kong. Click here for larger Cyberport map. Click here for larger floor plan. Shuttle Bus Service To Cyberport Day 1 (Sat) - 2 buses departs from Admiralty Centre 海富中心 (near McDonald) at 09:00 / 09:15 Day 2 (Sun) - 2 buses departs from Admiralty Centre 海富中心 (near McDonald) at 12:00 / 12:15 Depart From Cyberport Day 1 (Sat) - 3 buses depart to Admiralty MTR station at 18:00 Day 2 (Sun) - 2 buses depart to Admiralty MTR station at 18:00 Transportation By Bus 30X Central (via Pok Fu Lam, Wah Fu) Detail 73 Stanley (via Repulse Bay, Wong Chuk Hang, Aberdeen, Wah Fu) Detail 970 So Uk Estate (via Sham Shui Po, Prince Edward, Mong Kok, Yau Ma Tei, Jordan) Detail By Minibus 10 Causeway Bay (Jaffe Road) 58 Aberdeen - Cyberport - Kennedy Town (North Street) 69 Quarry Bay (Hoi Chak Street) 69A Aberdeen Main Road (outside St. Peter Secondary School) 69X Causeway Bay (Lockhart Road) PyCon HK 2016 Committee',
