    bodyHtml:
      '<div class="jumbotron dark-sections">\n           <div class="container">\n             <h1><span class="brand-blue">Talk: Decorators Demystified</span></h1>\n             <h2>Speaker: Akul Mehra (akul08) </h2>\n             <p>Language: English (with English Slides)</p>\n             <div class="progress" style="width: 80%;">\n                 <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-success" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="1" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="3" style="width: 33%;">\n                     Beginner\n                 </div>\n             </div>\n           </div>\n         </div>\n\n        <div class="container">\n          <div class="row">\n            <div class="col-sm-5">\n              <img src="/2016/remote/img.opensource.hk/akul-mehra.jpg" alt="Photo of Akul Mehra" class="img-thumbnail">\n            </div>\n            <div class="col-sm-5">\n              <h3>About Speaker</h3>\n              <p class="topic">I\'m a Computer Science Junior pursuing my Btech from Maharaja Surajmal Institute of Technology, New Delhi, India. I\'m a Pythonista, Web developer and geek. I love technology and hacking my way through them. I\'m also part of the team which won AngelHack Code for Impact prize. I was also part of Hack@MSIT our first college hackathon as a coorganiser. Love to learn new things and implement them in life.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class="row">\n            <div class="col-sm-12">\n              <h3>About the Topic</h3>\n              <p>\n                <ul>\n                  <li>Intro to functions</li>\n                  <li>Functions as Objects</li>\n                  <li>What are decorators</li>\n                  <li>Understanding how they work</li>\n                  <li>Useful Examples</li>\n                  <li>Class Decorators</li>\n                </ul>\n                <a target="_blank" href="http://slides.com/akul08/demystifying-decorator#/">http://slides.com/akul08/demystifying-decorator#/</a>\n              </p>\n              <p>Tags: Decorator, Function, Everything Is Object</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <hr>\n\n        <footer>\n          <p>PyCon HK 2016 Committee</p>\n        </footer>\n      </div>\n    </div>',
    visibleText:
      "Talk: Decorators Demystified Speaker: Akul Mehra (akul08) Language: English (with English Slides) Beginner About Speaker I'm a Computer Science Junior pursuing my Btech from Maharaja Surajmal Institute of Technology, New Delhi, India. I'm a Pythonista, Web developer and geek. I love technology and hacking my way through them. I'm also part of the team which won AngelHack Code for Impact prize. I was also part of Hack@MSIT our first college hackathon as a coorganiser. Love to learn new things and implement them in life. About the Topic Intro to functions Functions as Objects What are decorators Understanding how they work Useful Examples Class Decorators http://slides.com/akul08/demystifying-decorator#/ Tags: Decorator, Function, Everything Is Object PyCon HK 2016 Committee",
